# Cron & Governance Sweep

These components bypass the orchestrator graph and run deterministically on schedule.

1. **Governance Auditor:** Daily sweep verifying PID on file, stated objectives, unowned open actions, orphaned actions, and stage boundaries.
2. **EOM Financial Checkpoint:** Monthly cost tolerance check. Fires last Friday of the month. Raises deterministic action (`ACTION-EOM-{hash}-{yyyy-mm}`).
3. **Sprint Boundary Watchdog:** Queries Active sprints whose `endDate` has passed. Raises deterministic action (`ACTION-SPRINT-OVERDUE-{hash}`).
